  "id": "coparenting",
  "term": "coparenting",
  "definition": "Coparenting is the way parents work together in their shared responsibility for raising a child, including whether they support or interfere with each other’s parenting. In family systems terms, it reflects how caregivers coordinate within a three-person family relationship that can help create a balanced environment for the child.",
